{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039920/extras/035b33c43f69be06087580d91e89eba6.avif?t=1758925949\" data-has-big width=800 height=108 /></span><i><strong></strong></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039920/extras/afda0157e05e16da4ddbeb735b7b1f78.poster.avif?t=1758925949\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039920/extras/afda0157e05e16da4ddbeb735b7b1f78.webm?t=1758925949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039920/extras/afda0157e05e16da4ddbeb735b7b1f78.mp4?t=1758925949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a quirky adventure with four unique main characters as they seek their truth, battling gods, colossal corporations, and bizarre foes along the way. Unravel the Eternal Eclipse mystery and uncover the world's ancient secrets! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>This story contains adult humor and some mature themes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039920/extras/e5416413a33520407f4935d3ca48b686.avif?t=1758925949\" data-has-big width=800 height=117 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Navigate the world with a platformer-inspired system, allowing you to climb, jump off, and hoist up ledges, breaking free from classic grid-based movement.</strong> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039920/extras/3bb7a9021593d490fd326a44c9cb11e6.poster.avif?t=1758925949\" width=